OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, will extend northeast this
OL,7,Fmorning. Then wet this afternoon
OL,8,Fbefore drier weather spreads northeast
OL,9,Flater. Strong southerly winds along
OL,10,Fexposed coasts at first.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCentral Belt and south mainly
OL,13,Fdry with clear periods. Argyll will be
OL,14,Fcloudier at times with showers,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy. Brisk
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly winds along the Argyll
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,18,
OL,19,CMonday:FA mostly dry day with some
OL,20,Fgood spells of sunshine. A few showers
OL,21,Facross Argyll in the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
